  "2026-10-30T23:52:22.479Z",codex-agent,"Resumed delivery: reviewed retained README and generated window artifacts; rejected only temporary-fixture merge attributes. Next merge current main, preserve append-only tracker history, prove all three acceptance criteria with behavioral reverts, validate a public tracker copy, and run npm/Bun release gates with two workers."
  "2026-10-30T23:55:06.544Z",codex-agent,"Merged current main source and toolchain (SDK 2026.10.27), retaining all new progress/variance commands. Window reads request native event-chain verification. Public-data read-only validation at main 57cc37a: 109 items, 1099 mutation events, 110 streams, 2 pages, 224 authoritative files unchanged; 14663-byte JSON packet, identical restart, complete preview. Added reproducible validation entry and six-host packed window acceptance."
  "2026-10-30T23:58:21.627Z",codex-agent,"Verified four behavioral mutants in a disposable copy: advancing during preview breaks restart equality; timestamp-only membership drops the late event; disabling history regression certification reports lost streams complete; bypassing cursor coverage certification reports a damaged boundary complete. Each selected mutant exits 1; restored implementation passes all four selected regressions. Also fixed cursorless terminal pages, certification of more than ten deleted streams, and packet output contention. Stdout-only calls now preview because host rendering occurs after handler return; admission requires atomic file delivery under the cursor lease."
  "2026-10-31T00:01:38.049Z",codex-agent,"Pinned pm linked-test execution passed 33 tests: 521 seeded operations, 27 windows, 458 SDK events partitioned exactly. Disposable behavioral reverts each failed as expected; restored four-case selection passed 4/4. Delivery-before-retention failure recovery and peer interleaving are covered. Running complete npm then Bun release checks serially with isolated git identity and two test workers."
